WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Went to Changbai Mountain

2
00:00:01,080 --> 00:00:03,520
I collected three thousand-year-old human stems in half a day.

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:06,240
Then he sold it to the eldest lady of the Fan family for 3.9 billion.

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,920
She's going treasure hunting again tomorrow

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:10,000
The big one will directly exceed 100 billion.

6
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,280
Not for billionaires

7
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,640
Such a wonderful thing

8
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,320
Old Yang must be allowed to open his eyes.

9
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,510
This kid actually pretended to be dead and refused to answer me.

10
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:21,230
Zhang Tong accepted eight beauties last night

11
00:00:21,230 --> 00:00:23,630
How about taking them shopping now?

12
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:25,150
Eyes can't be tangled

13
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,950
Yang Bo has good PS skills

14
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:28,310
Why don't you believe it?

15
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:29,750
Brother Tong is now worth tens of billions

16
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,630
This is all real people, okay, Luo Pang

17
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:32,550
There is a limit to bragging

18
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:34,550
I know Zhang Tong opened a fruit shop and the manager talked about it

19
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,390
He is now trying to start a small business

20
00:00:36,390 --> 00:00:38,550
Starting a chain store is still a long way from being the richest man.

21
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,190
Don't brag for him. It's so good.

22
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,390
If you don’t believe it, pull me down

23
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,990
When will you return to school for defense after the new year?

24
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:44,890
Brother, a few words

25
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:45,890
I'm too busy at work

26
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:47,890
And I'm probably in love
